('a4d5b628-2b94-4258-bb02-a78852f0954f', 'Dubai Package', '<pre data-language="plain">
Experience the perfect blend of luxury, adventure, and unforgettable city experiences in Dubai. 
Stay at the elegant Hyatt Place Dubai Al Wasl or a similar hotel while exploring the city’s iconic attractions, enjoying a magical Marina Dhow Cruise, and experiencing an exciting Desert Safari with BBQ dinner. 
A perfect getaway combining comfort, culture, and entertainment.
</pre>', 'Dubai', NULL, '4.5', 'services/1778065412407-c1mnp1c7jk.jpeg', '[]', 'packages', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-06 11:09:40.372+00', '2026-05-07 14:26:59.838+00', '[]', '[]', NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '[]', '', '', NULL, '[]', NULL, '["5 Nights Stay at Hyatt Place Dubai Al Wasl (or Similar)", "Daily Bed & Breakfast", "Return Airport Transfers", "Half-Day Dubai City Tour", "Marina Dhow Cruise Experience", "Desert Safari with BBQ Dinner"]', '[]', '["Exclude Air ticket "]', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(10, 10, 10); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">*&nbsp;Conditions&nbsp;apply,&nbsp;subject&nbsp;to&nbsp;availability&nbsp;</span></p>', NULL, 'services/1778065626660-i95850smhd.jpg', False, 0, 'services/1778066023543-eu88fclt08f.jpg', False, 'Limited Time', True, False, 'Experience Dubai in style — where golden deserts meet dazzling skylines and unforgettable memories begin.', NULL, NULL, 12, '[]', NULL, '0', NULL),
('4ab6c93f-ce5c-42dc-8f4f-e3a4f3c43324', 'Istanbul  Package', '<ul><li>5&nbsp;Nights’&nbsp;Stay&nbsp;at&nbsp;Four&nbsp;Lions&nbsp;Taksim&nbsp;Hotel&nbsp;(or&nbsp;Similar)</li><li>Bed&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Breakfast</li><li>Airport&nbsp;Transfers</li><li>Full-Day&nbsp;Bosphorus&nbsp;Tour</li><li>Full-Day&nbsp;Bursa&nbsp;Tour</li><li>Old&nbsp;City&nbsp;Tour</li></ul><p></p><p>Experience&nbsp;the&nbsp;vibrant&nbsp;charm&nbsp;of&nbsp;Istanbul&nbsp;with&nbsp;its&nbsp;rich&nbsp;history,&nbsp;stunning&nbsp;architecture,&nbsp;scenic&nbsp;Bosphorus&nbsp;views,&nbsp;and&nbsp;unforgettable&nbsp;cultural&nbsp;attractions.</p>', 'Istanbul', NULL, '4.5', 'services/1778149649444-naqvj21jrp.jpg', '[]', 'packages', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-07 10:22:47.356+00', '2026-05-07 14:37:34.94+00', '[]', '[]', NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '[]', '', '', NULL, '[]', NULL, '["Cost of package per person sharing double room"]', '[]', '["Exclude Air ticket  & Visa for Istanbul"]', NULL, '<p><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;Conditions&nbsp;apply,&nbsp;subject&nbsp;to&nbsp;availability</span></p>', NULL, 'services/1778149675059-ep9p3z6s23i.jpg', False, 0, 'services/1778149766499-9l4u92wfjd.jpg', False, 'Limited Time', True, False, 'Discover the Magic of Istanbul with Iconic Landmarks, Scenic Cruises & Timeless Cultural Experiences.', NULL, NULL, 12, '[]', NULL, '0', 'Turkey'),
('5b4a52c2-188f-459b-902c-2ecadf770d50', 'Le Cardinal Exclusive Resort', '<p><span style="color: rgb(92, 92, 92); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Le&nbsp;Cardinal&nbsp;Exclusive&nbsp;Resort&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Spa&nbsp;offers&nbsp;the&nbsp;perfect&nbsp;escape&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;hustle&nbsp;and&nbsp;bustle&nbsp;of&nbsp;daily&nbsp;life,&nbsp;providing&nbsp;a&nbsp;serene&nbsp;environment&nbsp;for&nbsp;relaxation&nbsp;as&nbsp;well&nbsp;as&nbsp;exciting&nbsp;activities&nbsp;for&nbsp;those&nbsp;seeking&nbsp;adventure.&nbsp;Nestled&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;tranquil&nbsp;village&nbsp;of&nbsp;Trou&nbsp;aux&nbsp;Biches,&nbsp;the&nbsp;resort&nbsp;boasts&nbsp;a&nbsp;long&nbsp;stretch&nbsp;of&nbsp;pristine&nbsp;white&nbsp;sandy&nbsp;beach.</span></p><p><span style="color: rgb(92, 92, 92); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Whether&nbsp;you&#39;re&nbsp;looking&nbsp;to&nbsp;unwind&nbsp;in&nbsp;peaceful&nbsp;surroundings&nbsp;or&nbsp;indulge&nbsp;in&nbsp;more&nbsp;adrenaline-pumping&nbsp;experiences,&nbsp;Le&nbsp;Cardinal&nbsp;caters&nbsp;to&nbsp;all&nbsp;preferences.&nbsp;Conveniently&nbsp;located,&nbsp;the&nbsp;resort&nbsp;is&nbsp;just&nbsp;15&nbsp;km&nbsp;from&nbsp;Port-Louis,&nbsp;the&nbsp;vibrant&nbsp;capital&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritius,&nbsp;and&nbsp;5&nbsp;km&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;lively&nbsp;town&nbsp;of&nbsp;Grand-Baie.&nbsp;The&nbsp;international&nbsp;airport&nbsp;is&nbsp;situated&nbsp;50&nbsp;km&nbsp;away,&nbsp;ensuring&nbsp;easy&nbsp;access&nbsp;to&nbsp;this&nbsp;tropical&nbsp;haven.</span></p><p></p><p>CHECK&nbsp;IN&nbsp;:&nbsp;14&nbsp;HRS</p><p>CHECK&nbsp;OUT&nbsp;:&nbsp;12&nbsp;HRS</p><p></p><p>Meal&nbsp;Time:</p><p>•&nbsp;Breakfast:&nbsp;Gastronomic&nbsp;Restaurant&nbsp;(07:00&nbsp;–&nbsp;10:00)</p><p>•&nbsp;Lunch:&nbsp;Gastronomic&nbsp;Restaurant&nbsp;(12:00&nbsp;–&nbsp;13:30)</p><p>•&nbsp;Dinner:&nbsp;Gastronomic&nbsp;Restaurant&nbsp;(19:30&nbsp;–&nbsp;22:00</p>', 'Trou Aux Biches', 'Mauritius', '4.5', 'services/1777552339697-hf8erxjlkdn.jpg', '["Free wifi ", "Free Secured parking  ", " Free Water Sport ", "Fitness Gym", "mini club", "spa", "restaurant ", "swimming pool", "beach bar"]', 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-30 12:32:32.926+00', '2026-05-05 16:56:23.145+00', '[]', '[]', NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1777697952566-a2ijdtbdvn.jpg", "services/1777697964934-hc3baz50iow.jpg", "services/1777697974549-edxuxits42d.jpg", "services/1777698011868-z775adxbf5.webp", "services/1777698026732-on72mit7d7k.jpg", "services/1777698035230-wr47zeqfw4.jpg"]', '', '', NULL, '[]', NULL, '[]', '["Half Board [Breakfast & Dinner]", "All Inclusive [Breakfast, Lunch & Dinner / Unlimited drinks as from 11hr00 - 22hr45 (Soft drink,juice, water, beer, selected wine & Local spirits]"]', '["Half Board [Lunch & Drinks not included, all drinks chargeable]", ""]', NULL, '<ul><li>1st&nbsp;Child&nbsp;Stay&nbsp;for&nbsp;Free&nbsp;and&nbsp;Eat&nbsp;for&nbsp;Free</li><li>3&nbsp;Minimum&nbsp;Nights&nbsp;</li></ul>', NULL, 'services/1777553106156-cd2s0zktzu6.jpg', False, 0, 'services/1777553063625-x7vv6zd2iqg.jpg', False, 'Limited Time', True, False, 'Le Cardinal Exclusive Resort & Spa offers the perfect escape from the hustle and bustle of daily life, providing a serene environment for relaxation as well as exciting activities for those seeking adventure.', NULL, NULL, 12, '[{"id": "1777999675798", "label": "Half Board"}, {"id": "1777999677549", "label": "All Inclusive"}]', NULL, '0', NULL),
('6e55f700-0585-4c44-b28a-870a6be06bbf', 'Chalets Chamarel', '<p>Chalets&nbsp;Chamarel&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;unique&nbsp;property&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;island.&nbsp;The&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;offers&nbsp;9&nbsp;Double&nbsp;deluxe&nbsp;chalets&nbsp;and&nbsp;2&nbsp;spacious&nbsp;suites&nbsp;perched&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;ridges&nbsp;of&nbsp;Chamarel&nbsp;mountain&nbsp;‘Piton&nbsp;La&nbsp;Porte’&nbsp;with&nbsp;exceptional&nbsp;panoramic&nbsp;views&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;west&nbsp;coast&nbsp;on&nbsp;one&nbsp;side&nbsp;and&nbsp;breathtaking&nbsp;views&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;forests&nbsp;of&nbsp;Chamarel&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;other.</p><p>On&nbsp;the&nbsp;west&nbsp;coast&nbsp;of&nbsp;Mauritius,&nbsp;43&nbsp;km&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;airport.&nbsp;It’s&nbsp;located&nbsp;just&nbsp;after&nbsp;the&nbsp;Seven&nbsp;Coloured&nbsp;Earths&nbsp;Chamarel&nbsp;and&nbsp;share&nbsp;the&nbsp;same&nbsp;entrance.&nbsp;The&nbsp;closest&nbsp;beach&nbsp;is&nbsp;15km&nbsp;away,&nbsp;50&nbsp;km&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;capital&nbsp;city&nbsp;of&nbsp;Port-Louis&nbsp;as&nbsp;well&nbsp;as&nbsp;being&nbsp;15km&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;closest&nbsp;shopping&nbsp;center.</p><p>Adults-only&nbsp;hotel&nbsp;(as&nbsp;from&nbsp;15&nbsp;years)</p><p></p><p>CHECK&nbsp;IN&nbsp;:&nbsp;14&nbsp;HRS</p><p>CHECK&nbsp;OUT&nbsp;:&nbsp;11&nbsp;HRS</p><p></p>', 'Chamarel', 'South Coast', '4.5', 'services/1778226060777-dcq6ktjn3pd.jpg', '["Free Wifi", "Swimming Pool", "scenic viewpoints", "Restaurant & Bar", "Air conditioning in rooms", "sea view", "Free parking"]', 'hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-08 07:50:59.854+00', '2026-05-08 07:50:59.854+00', '[]', '[]', NULL, 'active', NULL, NULL, '["services/1778226559681-xc6jt3odpq.webp", "services/1778226568920-536rdg34tsn.webp", "services/1778226576507-vd53gte8g3b.webp", "services/1778226588769-m14mifk52m8.webp", "services/1778226596488-kirpmdqf3w8.jpg", "services/1778226616673-obfvwwfscra.webp", "services/1778226630976-p3g4iivi1b.jpg", "services/1778226647599-lgoid4240cn.jpg"]', '', '', NULL, '[]', NULL, '[]', '[]', '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'services/1778226081379-7ul4lxvo1ak.jpg', False, 0, 'services/1778226095587-slnrhs4z5r.jpg', False, 'Limited Time', True, False, 'Chalet Chamarel is an adults-only eco-retreat in Mauritius offering hillside chalets with panoramic ocean, forest, and mountain views.', NULL, NULL, 12, '[{"id": "1778226734417", "label": "Half Board"}]', NULL, '0', NULL),
('736e926d-c452-443b-99b4-991a97b71cf7', 'Bangkok Package', '<ul><li>6&nbsp;Nights’&nbsp;Stay&nbsp;at&nbsp;Century&nbsp;Park&nbsp;Hotel&nbsp;(or&nbsp;Similar)</li><li>Bed&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Breakfast</li><li>Airport&nbsp;Transfers</li><li>Chao&nbsp;Phraya&nbsp;Dinner&nbsp;Cruise&nbsp;(Shared&nbsp;Basis)</li><li>Half-Day&nbsp;City&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Temple&nbsp;Tour</li><li>Safari&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Marine&nbsp;Park&nbsp;with&nbsp;Lunch</li></ul><p></p><p></p><pre data-language="plain">
